File: withal-field-without-default.l4
  Hidden: no
  Range: 22:7-22:20
  Source: check
  Severity: DiagnosticSeverity_Error
  Code: check/withal-fields-without-default
  Message:
    WITHAL takes the default of every field, but these fields of

      Person (defined at withal-field-without-default.l4:13:9-15)

    have none:

      name of type STRING
      colour of type Colour
      flag of type BOOLEAN
      note of type MAYBE OF STRING
      home of type Address
      born of type DATE

    A default has to be a fixed value written out: a number, a string, TRUE,
    FALSE, NOTHING or a constructor of an enumeration. These fields hold
    something else, so they cannot have one:

      home of type Address
      born of type DATE

    So build the record with WITH and name the fields that have none.

